The audit calls the scheduler's own `retrievability()` / `schedule_review()`,
so an upstream model change flows into the measurements instead of drifting
away from them. `docs-for-dev/CALIBRATION.md` documents the method, the
thresholds and the measured results; `tools/calib-bench/simulate.py` reproduces
every number in it.